# Everything here is consumed inside Linux containers; keep LF on checkout
# regardless of the host platform or the developer's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The equivalence guarantee is a byte comparison against a fixture. A CRLF checkout
# of that fixture would make the suite pass in CI and fail on a Windows
# workstation, so the three source formats and the expected output are pinned again
# here rather than left to text=auto's content sniffing.
*.json text eol=lf
*.xml  text eol=lf
*.csv  text eol=lf
